    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 312.0, 623.015, 558.039, 709.303 ],
    "font" : "Frutiger-Light",
    "font size" : 8.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "On January 29, 2014, we announced that one of our wholly-owned subsidiaries had commenced cash tender offers for any and all of our US $750 million 6.375% senior notes due 2014 and our US $350 million 5.500% senior notes due 2014. The tender offer consideration will be US$1,000 for each $1,000 principal amount of notes (plus accrued and unpaid interest to, but not including, the settlement date) and a consent payment equal to US$2.50 per US$1,000 principal amount of notes."
